1
00:00:12,510 --> 00:00:15,070
Charts with trends is a type of chart

2
00:00:15,070 --> 00:00:18,270
that shows changes over time of different subjects.

3
00:00:18,770 --> 00:00:21,970
Meanwhile, charts of comparison do not show trends

4
