And within the three options of question two,

36
00:02:33,390 --> 00:02:36,850
sentence A, there are several reasons why people

37
00:02:36,850 --> 00:02:42,870
choose to play a musical instrument,  best expresses the main idea in the title of the paragraph,

38
00:02:42,870 --> 00:02:49,290
while B and C are just two details in the paragraph to clarify sentence A.

39
00:02:49,990 --> 00:02:53,310
