00:04:20,089 --> 00:04:24,750
2 is the deductive method, so G is a correct answer.

62
00:04:25,610 --> 00:04:28,170
A topic sentence is usually placed at the

63
00:04:28,170 --> 00:04:31,510
beginning of the paragraph, not anywhere in the paragraph.

64
00:04:32,250 --> 00:04:35,770
And because it's a topic sentence, not sentences,

65
00:04:36,390 --> 00:04:38,730
we only write it once in the paragraph,

66
00:04:39,010 --> 00:04:41,150
rather than repeating it many times.

67
00:04:43,210 --> 00:04:46,550
Alright, so we've just learned about the definition

68
00:04:46,550 --> 00:04:48,530
and features of a topic sentence.

69
00:04:49,270 --> 00:04:52,970
Now, let's move on to the components of

70
00:04:52,970 --> 00:04:54,210
a good topic sentence.

71
00:04:56,660 --> 00:05:00,240
A topic sentence is composed of two parts.

72
00:05:01,580 --> 00:05:03,880
In a topic sentence, there must be a topic, 

73
00:05:03,880 --> 00:05:06,520
or the subject we need to discuss.

74
00:05:07,080 --> 00:05:12,480
For example, in this sentence we have,  play a musical instrument as the topic.

75
00:05:12,820 --> 00:05:16,120
From this, we know the main idea of the whole paragraph.

76
00:05:17,120 --> 00:05:20,800
In addition, an effective topic sentence also 

77
00:05:20,800 --> 00:05:23,740
needs to have a controlling idea to show which

78
00:05:23,740 --> 00:05:26,820
aspect of the topic will be developed in the paragraph.

79
00:05:27,500 --> 00:05:30,200
Without this part, the sentence would only have

80
00:05:30,200 --> 00:05:33,560
the topic, people choose to play a musical instrument.

81
00:05:34,160 --> 00:05:37,160
This will make readers confused about which aspect

82
00:05:37,160 --> 00:05:40,080
of playing a musical instrument will be discussed.

83
00:05:40,660 --> 00:05:45,440
It could be advantages and disadvantages, or results

84
00:05:45,440 --> 00:05:49,740
of playing a musical instrument, or how often people play it.

85
00:05:52,490 --> 00:05:56,530
Thanks to the controlling idea, several reasons, the

86
00:05:56,530 --> 00:05:58,970
readers know that in this paragraph we will

87
00:05:58,970 --> 00:06:02,530
focus on the reasons why people play musical instruments.

88
00:06:04,580 --> 00:06:07,420
From here, we have the structure of a

89
00:06:07,420 --> 00:06:09,040
topic sentence as follows.

90
00:06:13,750 --> 00:06:16,670
Now let's have a try with a small task.

