Similarly, music is the topic.

107
00:07:39,470 --> 00:07:42,130
To discuss music, there are many things we

108
00:07:42,130 --> 00:07:45,690
can talk about, but the controlling idea has

109
00:07:45,690 --> 00:07:48,710
narrowed down the topic to various health benefits,

110
00:07:49,310 --> 00:07:53,830
so the paragraph will only focus on some health benefits of music.

111
00:07:56,240 --> 00:07:59,120
Different types of essays in IELTS in particular,

