00:09:01,400 --> 00:09:04,500
Even if it's about health, this is just

133
00:09:04,500 --> 00:09:06,320
one idea in the whole paragraph.

134
00:09:06,900 --> 00:09:11,220
And we also have another idea, fosters our communication skills, right?

135
00:09:11,760 --> 00:09:15,100
